{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Global energy demand has generally increased over the long term, although growth varies by country and year. Population growth is one driver: more people need transport, heating, cooling, industry and electricity. Economic development and greater access to appliances and technology can increase energy demand per person. However, energy efficiency improvements, changes in industry and government policies can reduce or slow demand. It is therefore too simplistic to say that energy use per person always increases everywhere.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 33.168, "words": [["Global", 0.102083], ["energy", 0.596875], ["demand", 0.9875], ["has", 1.313041], ["generally", 1.586458], ["increased", 2.08125], ["over", 2.563041], ["the", 2.797416], ["long", 2.875541], ["term,", 3.175], ["although", 3.695833], ["growth", 4.034375], ["varies", 4.294791], ["by", 4.633333], ["country", 4.802625], ["and", 5.154166], ["year.", 5.323458], ["Population", 6.484375], ["growth", 7.148458], ["is", 7.460958], ["one", 7.630208], ["driver:", 7.864583], ["more", 8.515625], ["people", 8.776041], ["need", 9.0495], ["transport,", 9.244791], ["heating,", 10.026041], ["cooling,", 10.716166], ["industry", 11.263041], ["and", 11.770833], ["electricity.", 11.888041], ["Economic", 13.606791], ["development", 14.179708], ["and", 14.856791], ["greater", 15.065125], ["access", 15.45575], ["to", 15.872416], ["appliances", 15.963541], ["and", 16.601583], ["technology", 16.770833], ["can", 17.369791], ["increase", 17.526041], ["energy", 17.95575], ["demand", 18.372416], ["per", 18.75], ["person.", 18.919291], ["However,", 20.208333], ["energy", 20.989583], ["efficiency", 21.341166], ["improvements,", 21.940125], ["changes", 22.851583], ["in", 23.294291], ["industry", 23.411458], ["and", 23.958333], ["government", 24.166666], ["policies", 24.609375], ["can", 25.117208], ["reduce", 25.286458], ["or", 25.651041], ["slow", 25.8